01:29:17.480 --> 01:29:19.084
Minnie?


01:29:32.120 --> 01:29:33.770
God damn it, Minnie.


01:29:34.440 --> 01:29:35.680
Sorry.


01:29:43.440 --> 01:29:45.408
Are you okay?


01:29:46.600 --> 01:29:48.011
Are you okay?


01:29:48.240 --> 01:29:50.447
- Yeah.
- Oh, my God, we were so worried about you.


01:29:50.520 --> 01:29:52.841
- I looked everywhere for you.
- You did?


01:29:52.920 --> 01:29:54.285
Of course.


01:29:55.200 --> 01:29:58.329
I've been looking all night. I've looked
every single night since you left.


01:29:58.400 --> 01:30:00.050
I was so afraid...


01:30:03.360 --> 01:30:05.567
- I'm so sorry.
- It's okay. Shh.


01:30:05.800 --> 01:30:07.086
I'm sorry.


01:30:10.120 --> 01:30:12.361
- I wanted to tell you about Monroe.
- No.


01:30:12.440 --> 01:30:13.930
- I really did. I just...
- Stop.


01:30:14.000 --> 01:30:15.001
- Didn't know how to tell you.
- No, please.


01:30:15.080 --> 01:30:17.128
- And I knew that you would be...
- Don't.


01:30:18.400 --> 01:30:19.765
Okay?


01:30:23.280 --> 01:30:25.408
I can't talk about that.


01:30:27.680 --> 01:30:29.444
Ever. Okay?


01:30:39.520 --> 01:30:41.124
- Okay.
- Okay.


01:32:01.040 --> 01:32:03.884
<i>"Dear Minnie,
thank you for your letter."</i>


01:32:03.960 --> 01:32:06.042
<i>"It is refreshing to receive
a letter from a girl,"</i>


01:32:06.120 --> 01:32:08.805
<i>"because most letters I get
are from greasy fan boys"</i>


01:32:08.880 --> 01:32:10.644
<i>"who think that I'm cute."</i>


01:32:10.720 --> 01:32:14.281
<i>"Keep drawing those comics.
Keep drawing anything you can."</i>


01:32:14.360 --> 01:32:16.124
<i>"Just keep drawing."</i>


01:32:16.200 --> 01:32:18.851
<i>"Oh, and I use indian ink as well."</i>


01:32:19.000 --> 01:32:20.923
<i>"Love, Aline Kominsky."</i>


01:32:21.000 --> 01:32:24.925
<i>Wrap your troubles in dreams.</i>


01:32:25.440 --> 01:32:29.445
<i>Send them all away.</i>


01:32:30.480 --> 01:32:34.530
<i>Put them in a bottle and.</i>


01:32:35.200 --> 01:32:36.725
<i>Across the seas.</i>


01:32:36.920 --> 01:32:39.605
<i>Did you ever go back to
your preschool once you had gotten big,</i>


01:32:39.680 --> 01:32:41.011
<i>and everything looked miniature,</i>


01:32:42.320 --> 01:32:43.970
<i>like the chairs and the monkey bars,</i>


01:32:44.320 --> 01:32:46.800
<i>just much smaller than you remembered?</i>


01:32:49.760 --> 01:32:51.842
<i>I know nothing's changed,</i>


01:32:51.920 --> 01:32:54.605
<i>but everything looks
totally different to me now.</i>


01:32:55.280 --> 01:32:58.602
<i>Just steal yourself a holiday.</i>


01:32:59.760 --> 01:33:02.730
<i>Crouching by the door.</i>


01:33:02.920 --> 01:33:04.649
It's 50 cents.


01:33:04.720 --> 01:33:06.245
Oh, thanks.


01:33:15.720 --> 01:33:17.563
- Hey.
- Hi.


01:33:18.120 --> 01:33:19.360
Hey.


01:33:21.600 --> 01:33:22.931
You're alone, or...


01:33:23.000 --> 01:33:27.085
No, Gretel's with me.
She went to find a bathroom.


01:33:27.160 --> 01:33:28.161
Ah.


01:33:30.640 --> 01:33:31.801
She had to pee.


01:33:33.360 --> 01:33:34.600
Yeah.


01:33:38.840 --> 01:33:40.808
So, you wanna buy a drawing?


01:33:41.720 --> 01:33:43.131
Or a 'zine?


01:33:45.520 --> 01:33:47.648
I have no money, you know?


01:33:48.680 --> 01:33:50.330
Jogging shorts and all.


01:33:50.400 --> 01:33:52.562
Here, take this one.


01:33:52.640 --> 01:33:55.849
You can give the 50 cents to my mom
the next time you see her.


01:33:57.120 --> 01:33:58.281
Oh.


01:34:01.200 --> 01:34:02.645
Thank you.


01:34:08.360 --> 01:34:10.488
Goodbye, Monroe.


01:34:13.240 --> 01:34:14.890
Goodbye, Minnie.


01:34:16.360 --> 01:34:19.443
<i>I'm better than you,
you son of a bitch.</i>


01:34:34.000 --> 01:34:38.324
<i>We can run to the mountains.</i>


01:34:38.560 --> 01:34:43.248
<i>We can sail the Emerald Sea.</i>


01:34:43.360 --> 01:34:44.600
<i>Drop a coin...</i>


01:34:44.680 --> 01:34:48.002
<i>I always thought
I wanted to be exactly like my mom.</i>


01:34:48.440 --> 01:34:50.602
<i>I got a girl
She's sick as can be.</i>


01:34:50.720 --> 01:34:52.210
<i>All the other boys wanna be like me.</i>


01:34:52.360 --> 01:34:54.966
<i>But she thinks she needs a man
to be happy.</i>


01:34:56.360 --> 01:34:57.691
<i>I don't.</i>


01:34:57.760 --> 01:34:59.967
<i>Danny.</i>


01:35:03.080 --> 01:35:05.242
If anyone asks, we're sisters.


01:35:06.520 --> 01:35:08.841
<i>Well I chased that girl
round the Frisco Bay.</i>


01:35:08.920 --> 01:35:11.321
<i>Don't believe everything your mama say.</i>


01:35:11.400 --> 01:35:12.401
<i>And, oh.</i>


01:35:13.560 --> 01:35:15.927
<i>So, maybe nobody loves me.</i>


01:35:16.720 --> 01:35:19.041
<i>Maybe nobody will ever love me.</i>


01:35:20.720 --> 01:35:24.122
<i>But maybe it's not about
being loved by somebody else.</i>


01:35:24.560 --> 01:35:29.248
<i>We can run to the mountains.</i>


01:35:29.320 --> 01:35:33.245
<i>We can sail the Emerald Sea.</i>


01:35:33.840 --> 01:35:38.607
<i>Drop a coin in every fountain</i>


01:35:38.680 --> 01:35:42.287
<i>'Cause it's true when I wake up
and I see you next to me</i>


01:35:43.320 --> 01:35:47.689
<i>'Cause it's true when I wake up
and I see you next to me.</i>


01:35:50.000 --> 01:35:53.004
<i>This is for all the girls
when they have grown.</i>


01:35:53.080 --> 01:35:56.209
<i>Signing off, trusty diary.</i>


01:35:57.440 --> 01:36:00.762
<i>Love, Minnie Goetze.</i>


01:38:19.320 --> 01:38:23.769
<i>What did you dream about last night?</i>


01:38:23.880 --> 01:38:28.044
<i>How did you feel when you woke up today?</i>


01:38:28.240 --> 01:38:32.768
<i>I had a dream about you last night.</i>


01:38:32.880 --> 01:38:37.124
<i>Why do they always end the same way?</i>


01:38:37.280 --> 01:38:41.842
<i>I wanna know what happened last night.</i>


01:38:41.920 --> 01:38:45.845
<i>After you closed your eyes.</i>


01:38:45.920 --> 01:38:50.528
<i>Was it scary or weird?
Or do you not remember.</i>


01:38:50.600 --> 01:38:55.401
<i>Did you want it to end or reprise?</i>


01:38:55.520 --> 01:39:01.368
<i>You don't have to dream.</i>


01:39:01.800 --> 01:39:03.962
<i>About me.</i>


01:39:04.520 --> 01:39:10.084
<i>I can't help but dream.</i>


01:39:10.760 --> 01:39:12.649
<i>About you.</i>


01:39:13.680 --> 01:39:19.369
<i>Woo, and there is nothing you can do.</i>


01:39:22.640 --> 01:39:28.170
<i>Woo, and there is nothing you can do.</i>


01:39:31.800 --> 01:39:35.771
<i>I had a dream where I was a princess.</i>


01:39:35.880 --> 01:39:40.090
<i>And I had to rule but I didn't know how.</i>


01:39:40.160 --> 01:39:44.961
<i>And before I could learn,
I turned into someone.</i>


01:39:45.040 --> 01:39:49.170
<i>I knew long ago but I don't know now.</i>


01:39:49.960 --> 01:39:54.284
<i>Then there's the one
where I'm watching my own life.</i>


01:39:54.400 --> 01:39:58.405
<i>Sung like an opera without any sound.</i>


01:39:58.480 --> 01:40:02.804
<i>When they get to the part
with the falling in love.</i>


01:40:02.880 --> 01:40:07.249
<i>The conductor runs off
and the curtain comes down.</i>


01:40:08.080 --> 01:40:13.325
<i>You don't have to dream.</i>


01:40:13.920 --> 01:40:16.207
<i>About me.</i>


01:40:16.880 --> 01:40:22.569
<i>But I can't help but dream.</i>


01:40:23.040 --> 01:40:25.725
<i>About you.</i>


01:40:26.160 --> 01:40:31.610
<i>Woo, and there is nothing you can do.</i>


01:40:35.040 --> 01:40:40.524
<i>Woo, and there is nothing you can do.</i>


01:40:44.240 --> 01:40:48.131
<i>I wake up and remember.</i>


01:40:48.320 --> 01:40:52.166
<i>Exactly how you feel.</i>


01:40:52.400 --> 01:40:56.928
<i>So pinch me, baby</i>


01:40:57.080 --> 01:41:01.085
<i>'Cause it's hard to know what's real.</i>


01:41:02.200 --> 01:41:06.524
<i>You put the postcard I sent.</i>


01:41:06.920 --> 01:41:10.720
<i>Under your pillow just to see.</i>


01:41:11.400 --> 01:41:15.246
<i>I don't care if it worked or what.</i>


01:41:15.440 --> 01:41:20.048
<i>It's enough that you're trying
to dream about me</i>


01:41:20.072 --> 01:41:36.072
<font color="#ffff80"><b>Hope it helped -> bozxphd</b></font>

